<title>USA: Norton McNaughton names Boneparth pres/COO.</title>
<headline>Norton McNaughton names Boneparth pres/COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norton McNaughton Inc said Tuesday that it has named Peter Boneparth president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>It said prior to his appointment, Boneparth was senior managing director and head of investment banking at Rodman &amp; Renshaw Capital Group Inc.</p>
<p>The company also said that Norton Sperling, cofounder and currently president, will assume the newly-created position of vice-chairman of the board of directors.</p>
</text>
